    <DisplayName>Agile Gauge: Cycle Time, WIP and Sprint Metrics for Scrum and Kanban Teams</DisplayName>
    <Description xml:space="preserve">Sprint health, flow analytics and portfolio delivery signals for Scrum and Kanban teams, inside an Azure Boards hub tab.</Description>
    <GalleryFlags>Paid Preview</GalleryFlags>
